OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMost areas will stay dry with
OL,6,Fsunny spells throughout the day.
OL,7,FHowever, cloud will thicken across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland and western Scotland,
OL,9,Fwith outbreaks of rain gradually
OL,10,Fspreading eastwards. Feeling rather
OL,11,Fwarm in the southeast. Becoming very
OL,12,Fwindy in the northwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRain across the northwest
OL,15,Fwill slowly edge southeast, becoming
OL,16,Fincreasingly fragmented. Elsewhere, it
OL,17,Fwill stay dry with variable cloud,
OL,18,Fwhile mist and fog patches may develop
OL,19,Fin the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
