OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FFog and low cloud will clear
OL,6,Ffrom some central and southern areas,
OL,7,Fleaving a warm, dry day for many.
OL,8,FCloudier skies in the north and west
OL,9,Fwill drift southeastwards.
